<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Amic year share dips, div held.</title>
<headline>Amic year share dips, div held.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Dec 31</p>
<p>			(billion rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, headline (cts)   1,476	 vs  1,569</p>
<p>    Shr, total net (cts)  1,492	 vs  1,603</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 545	   vs  same</p>
<p>    Headline earnings     1.02	  vs  1.04</p>
<p>    Total net earnings    1.03	  vs  1.06</p>
<p>    Operational earnings  1.99	  vs  same</p>
<p>    Turnover		  23.72	 vs  20.52</p>
<p>Full name: Anglo American Industrial Corp Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts polled by Reuters forecast adjusted earnings per share in a 1,470 to 1,525 cents range with consensus at 1,498.75 cents per share. They ranged total dividend for the year between 545 cents and 560 cents per share with consensus at 552.5 cents.  </p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
